  <div class="card"><h2>How long data is kept</h2>${chk('stRet', 'Delete old records automatically each day', c.retention.enabled)}<div class="row">${num('stR1', 'Usage logs (days)', c.retention.usageDays, 30, 3650)}${num('stR2', 'Message logs (days)', c.retention.outboxDays, 1, 365)}${num('stR3', 'Quote trail (days)', c.retention.quoteDays, 90, 3650)}${num('stR4', 'Audit log (days)', c.retention.auditDays, 90, 3650)}${num('stR5', 'Leads (days)', c.retention.leadDays, 30, 3650)}${num('stR6', 'Unsent drafts (days)', c.retention.draftDays, 7, 365)}</div><p class="muted">Agree these periods with your compliance officer. Quote trail and audit log are your evidence of fair selling, so keep them as long as the regulator expects.</p></div>
